# Foundry-style LEF/DEF layer map (sky130-like GDS numbers).
# Format: <lef-layer-name> <purpose> <gds-layer> <gds-datatype>
# This is the kind of map a PDK ships (e.g. OpenLane sky130A.map) and that the
# bare KLayout DEF reader ignores by default (falling back to compact 1..N).
met1 NET    68 20
met1 PIN    68 16
met1 LEFPIN 68 16
met1 LEFOBS 68 22
met1 SPNET  68 20
met1 VIA    68 20
via1 NET    67 44
via1 VIA    67 44
via1 SPNET  67 44
met2 NET    69 20
met2 PIN    69 16
met2 LEFPIN 69 16
met2 LEFOBS 69 22
met2 SPNET  69 20
met2 VIA    69 20
met1 PINNAME    68 5
met1 LEFPINNAME 68 5
met2 PINNAME    69 5
met2 LEFPINNAME 69 5
DIEAREA ALL 235 4
